 masterworks of American art to Greenwich and the region through an extraor
 dinary partnership with The Newark Museum of Art. Newark’s American art 
 collection ranks among the finest in the nation\, with exceptional holding
 s spanning from the colonial period and Hudson River School to the present
  day. Audiences will experience iconic paintings including Georgia O’Kee
 ffe’s White Flower on Red Earth\, No.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/eve
